$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure for the synthesis of
hexaoxonanes from acetals 1a-h and dihydroperoxides 2a-d Acetal 1a-h (2.6
mmol) was added to a solution of dihydroperoxide 2a-d (2 mmol) in 1.5 mL
of Et2O for 2a - 2с; 8-10 mL of THF for 2d. A solution of boron
trifluoride etherate (0.2-0.6 mol of BF3 • Et2O per mole of 2) in diethyl
ether (0.5 mL) (in the reactions with 2a-c) or THF (0.5 mL) (in the
reaction with 2d) was added to the reaction mixture at 0-5 ⁰С (in the
reaction with 2a), 20 ⁰С (in the reaction with 2b - d). Then the mixtures
were stirred at 20-25 ⁰С (in the reaction with 2a - d) for 3-8 h, or
55-60 ⁰С (in the reaction with 2d) for 1-5 h.
8,9,17,18,26,27-Hexaoxatrispiro[6.2.610.2.619.27]heptacosane (5e), yield
91% Mp = 107 – 109 °C (Et2O). (Mp 4 = 108 – 110 °C) Rf 0.47 (TLC, PE –
EA, 20:1). 1Н NMR (200.13 MHz), δ: 1.34-1.85 (m, 30H), 1.92-2.22 (m, 6H).
13С NMR (50.32 MHz), δ: 22.8, 30.0, 32.8, 112.7. Anal. Calcd for
C21H36O6: C, 65.60; H, 9.44. Found: C, 65.41; H, 9.62.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM New Preparation of 1,2,4,5,7,8-Hexaoxonanes
