$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 20,22-O-[(1R)-Ethylidene]-20-hydroxyecdyzone (RS-VII). A suspension of
1.0 g (2.08 mmol) of compound I, 8.0 mg of PMA. and 125 ml of acetic
aldehyde was stirred for 30 min at ~25 °C. The reaction mixture was
evaporated to 5 ml, 15 ml of 2% NaHCO3 solution was added, and the
reaction product was extracted into AcOEt (3x60 ml). The extract was
evaporated in a vacuum, and the residue was subjected to chromatography
on a column charged with 50 g of SiO2 (eluent CHCl3-MeOH, 9:1). We
obtained 0.95 g (90%) of compound (RS-VII) (R/S ~ 1:1). mp 98-102°C, [α]
D 22[α] D 22 32.1° (C 1.63, CHCl3). 1H NMR spectrum (C5D5N), δ, ppm(J,
Hz): 0.92 s (3H, H3C 18 ), 0.95 s (3H, H3C 19 ), 1.26 s (3H, H3C 21 ),
1.31 s (6H, H3C 26 and H3C 27 ), 1.38 d (3H, CH3C 1' , 3 J 5.0),
1.50-2.20 m (16H, CH2), 2.3-2.5 m (1H, HC 17 ), 2.68 t (1H, HC 5 , 3 J
8.0), 3.10 m (1H, HC 9 , w1/2 26), 3.77 m (1H, HC 22 , w1/2 18), 3.88 m
(1H, HC 3 , w1/2 12), 4.10 m (1H, HC 2 , w1/2 25), 5.06 q and 5.15 q
(1'R/1'S ~ 1:1) (1H, HC 1' , 3 J 5.0), 6.10 br.s (1H, HC 7 , w1/2 6.5).
13C NMR spectrum (C5D5N), δ, ppm: 17.0 q (C 18 ), 20.9 t (C 11 ), 21.7 q
and 21.9 q (CH3C 1' ), 22.0 t (C 16 ), 23.6 q (C 19 ), 24.0 t (C 23 ),
24.2 q (C 21 ), 26.2 t (C 15 ), 29.5 q and 29.9 q (C 26 and C 27 ), 31.3t
(C 4 and C 12 ), 35.2 d (C 9 ), 37.6 s (C 10 ), 38.3t (C 1 ), 41.8 t (C
24 ), 47.7 s (C 13 ), 50.4 d (C 17 ), 51.2 d (C 5 ), 69.1 s (C 25 ), 71.4
d (C 3 ), 73.9 d (C 2 ), 79.5 d and 84.9 d (C 22 ), 84.2 s (C 20 ), 84.6
s (C 14 ), 101.1 d and 101.3 d (C 1' ), 121.0 d (C 7 ), 164.8 s (C 8 ),
202.1 s (C 6 ).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, product depends on reaction conditions
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM New derivatives of 20-hydroxyecdyzone. Viticosterone E synthesis
