$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of [η 6-(3,3-Diethoxypropylbenzene)RuCl2]2 (3b). RuCl3 . xH2O
(58.3 mg, 0.21 mmol) and 2 (143 mg, 1.05 mmol) in ethanol (12 mL) was
refluxed at 100 °C under a N2 atmosphere for 4 h. The reaction mixture
was concentrated in vacuo, and diethyl ether was added to yield an orange
precipitate. The precipitate was washed with diethyl ether (2x) and dried
in vacuo. Yield 73.0 mg, 90.3%. 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ/ppm: 1.15 (t, 6H,
OCH2CH3) 3J = 6.99 Hz, 1.86-1.93 (m, 2H, PhCH2CH2CH), 2.62 (t, 2H,
PhCH2CH2CH), 3.39-3.65 (m, 4H, OCH2CH3), 4.47 (t, 1H, PhCH2CH2CH-), 3J =
5.43 Hz, 5.39 (d, 2H, Ph-Hortho), 5.56-5.60 (m, 1H, Ph-Hpara), 5.62-5.66
(m, 2H, Ph-Hmeta); single crystals from diethyl ether into DCM solution.
